# ============================================================================
# NEW BARK TOWN, expanded  (24x20 blocks, buffer 780/1300; vanilla 10x9)
# ============================================================================
# KEPT FROM VANILLA (same relative layout, so it reads as New Bark):
#   Elm's Lab NW, player's house NE of it, neighbour's house SW, Elm's
#   house SE; water on the east edge leading to Route 27; Route 29 leaves
#   west on a single road where the teacher stops you; town sign on the road.
# ADDED (pokefollow-style, cf. its Pallet Town 10x9 -> 24x20):
#   Bark Brook: a N-S stream splits the town into the vanilla quadrants,
#     crossed by two plank footbridges (89); Surfable later for an item.
#   Hedged yards (65) around every plot; tree clumps (61) and flower beds.
#   North ledge belt: a hilltop meadow above the lab ("Windy Hill"); the
#     ledge is a one-way hop back down, the way up is the gap by the brook.
#   Jetty (89) into the east sea: the fisher moves here, Surf to Route 27.
#   Two new houses (SW, SE) and Elm's research field: a hedged tall-grass
#     plot south-west, reached by its gate gap, where Elm's study Pokemon
#     live (scripted encounter or a place to show starters later).
# CONNECTIONS: W rows 8-9 (steps 16-19) -> Route 29 E exit. E edge is sea
#   (rows 3-19) -> Route 27. Brook runs off N and S edges into the border.
# TODO: brook edges at N/S just stop at the border trees; check in PM++.
# ============================================================================
ref NewBarkTown
key a=18 b=1f c=19 d=1c e=77 f=1e g=16
key 1=14 2=15 B=89 U=65 o=0a r=31 R=32 l=4b L=53
grid:
TTTTTTTTTTT[]TTTTTTTTTTT
TTTT,,*,#,,[],,#,*,TTTTT
TTT,,,,,,,,[],,,,,,,(^^^
TTT=======l[],,,,,,,[~~~
TTT,abc,,,,[],,,ac,#[~~~
TT#,def,S,,[],,,gf,,[~r~
TT,*,.,*,*,[],*,.,*,[~~~
TTUUU.UUUU,[],UU.UUU[~~~
........s..BB.......BBB~
...........BB.......[~~~
TTUUU.UUUU,[],UUUU.U[~~~
TT,*12,*,#,[],#,ac,*[~R~
TT,,.,,,,,,[],,,gf,,[~~~
TT,,.......BB....,,,[~~~
TT#,.,12,,,[],,12,#,[~~~
TT,,....,,,[],,..,,,[~r~
TTUUU.UUUU,[],*,,,*,[~~~
TTT""""""T,[],,#,,,,[~~~
TTT""*"""T,[],,,,*,,[~~~
TTTTTTTTTTT[]TTTTTTT[~~~
end
exit W 0 17
exit PIER 45 16
exit HILL 8 3
obj warp 10 11 ElmsLab
obj warp 33 11 PlayersHouse
obj warp 9 23 NeighborsHouse
obj warp 33 25 ElmsHouse
obj warp 13 29 NewHouseW
obj warp 31 29 NewHouseE
obj npc 6 16 Teacher right
obj npc 43 16 Fisher right
obj npc 7 9 Rival right
obj npc 18 4 Youngster down
obj sign 17 9 ElmsLabSign
obj sign 31 11 PlayersHouseSign
obj hidden 10 2 hill_corner
obj item 39 31 shore_item
